## Common Anti-Patterns

- ❌ Writing Parquet directly → ✅ Always use Delta Lake format
- ❌ No medallion layers → ✅ Implement Bronze-Silver-Gold architecture
- ❌ Ignoring data quality → ✅ Use DLT expectations or validation checks
- ❌ No checkpoints in streaming → ✅ Always specify checkpoint location
- ❌ Over-partitioning → ✅ Use Liquid Clustering for most use cases
- ❌ No optimization → ✅ Enable Predictive Optimization or manual OPTIMIZE
- ❌ Full table scans → ✅ Use partition pruning and Z-Ordering/Liquid Clustering

